        "slc_083e29af666849fc7249b8c6f56f1b4408bb03579ef0f0202704abad251ebb9a"
      ],
      "text": "The goal controller dispatches native subagents per harness (Codex spawn_agent with bounded waits, Claude Code background Task polling, Gemini @generalist, OpenCode @mention), with 60-second poll boundaries, heartbeats, and immediate persistence of completed children."
    },
