      "text": "Workflow state lives in repository artifacts: active changes hold proposal.md, tasks.md, state.json, verification.md, and review.md; goals add design.md, implementation-plan.md, task-graph.json, worker/reviewer/evidence artifacts, so later sessions can resume without replaying chat."
