        "slc_2b31189fc789d3bf5692c9b1c1590d015b444be4a40861f2fe68d816f2455a74",
        "slc_a7dca06f0e632eb9c2d40f5946ba48e53ca6b9904845df5a3ad95395f76a114c",
        "slc_dcd17395f49f05b4f53c0396701e6f1df97b366570b21cf8d19af90062aa8b70"
      ],
      "text": "For Claude Code, `ospec session hook --target claude --apply` installs a hook bundle under .ospec/hooks/claude merged into .claude/settings.json that announces dispatches, hard-blocks subagent dispatch while a required decision is pending, and is Claude-only and opt-in."
    },
